dER\:ff1b  \:27e8\[Sigma]\:27e9Xe = \[Sum]A \[Eta]A \[Integral] F(v) \
\[Sigma]A(v) dv\:3002", "Text", ExpressionUUID ->
          "a9806afe-43fe-7845-a88f-d7f54c4a60f8"],
        Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Clear[RecoilEnergyBoundsKeV, \
TotalCrossSection];\nRecoilEnergyBoundsKeV[a_Integer,v_?NumericQ,ms_?NumericQ\
,p_Association] := Module[\n {m,ma,beta,e,s,root,ein,eout,pii,pf,lo,hi}, (* \
\:8d28\:5fc3\:7cfb\:8fd0\:52a8\:5b66\:53d8\:91cf *)\n \
{m,ma,beta}=N[Rationalize[{p[\"mchi\"],Global`XeNuclearMassGeV[a],v/299792.45\
8},0],40]; (* \
\:63d0\:9ad8\:8ba1\:7b97\:7cbe\:5ea6\:4ee5\:51cf\:5c11\:5927\:8d28\:91cf\
\:76f8\:51cf\:8bef\:5dee *)\n e=m/Sqrt[1-beta^2]; s=m^2+ma^2+2 ma e; \
root=Sqrt[s]; (* \:5165\:5c04\:80fd\:91cf\:4e0e\:603b\:4e0d\:53d8\:91cf *)\n \
If[root <= ma+m+ms,Return[{0.,0.}]]; (* \
\:4e09\:4f53\:672b\:6001\:9608\:503c\:672a\:6253\:5f00 *)\n \
ein=(s+ma^2-m^2)/(2 root); (* \
\:521d\:6001\:6838\:5728\:8d28\:5fc3\:7cfb\:4e2d\:7684\:80fd\:91cf *)\n \
eout=(s+ma^2-(m+ms)^2)/(2 root); (* \
\:6700\:5c0f\:7ec4\:5408\:8d28\:91cf\:5bf9\:5e94\:7684\:672b\:6001\:6838\
\:80fd\:91cf *)\n pii=Sqrt[Max[0,ein^2-ma^2]]; pf=Sqrt[Max[0,eout^2-ma^2]]; \
(* \:521d\:672b\:6001\:8d28\:5fc3\:52a8\:91cf *)\n lo=(ein eout-pii \
pf-ma^2)/ma; hi=(ein eout+pii pf-ma^2)/ma; (* t=-2 mA ER *)\n N[10^6 \
{Max[0,lo],Max[0,hi]},16] (* GeV \:8f6c keV \
*)\n];\nTotalCrossSection[a_Integer,v_?NumericQ,ms_?NumericQ,dm_?NumericQ,p_A\
ssociation] := Module[{bounds,integrand},\n \
bounds=RecoilEnergyBoundsKeV[a,v,ms,p]; (* \
\:5168\:90e8\:8fd0\:52a8\:5b66\:5141\:8bb8\:53cd\:51b2\:80fd\:91cf\:ff0ckeV \
*)\n If[bounds[[2]]<=bounds[[1]],Return[0.]]; (* \
\:9608\:503c\:4ee5\:4e0b\:603b\:622a\:9762\:4e3a\:96f6 *)\n \
integrand[er_?NumericQ]:=10^-6 DifferentialCrossSection[a,er,v,ms,dm,p]; (* \
dER \:4ece keV \:6362\:4e3a GeV *)\n \
NIntegrate[integrand[er],{er,bounds[[1]],bounds[[2]]},Method->{\"GlobalAdapti\
ve\",\"SymbolicProcessing\"->0},AccuracyGoal->Infinity,PrecisionGoal->2,MaxRe\
cursion->5] (* \:7ed3\:679c GeV^-2 \
*)\n];\nClear[NaturalAveragedTotalCrossSection];\nNaturalAveragedTotalCrossSe\
ction[ms_?NumericQ,dm_?NumericQ,p_Association] := \
Module[{vmax,opt,integrand},\n vmax=p[\"vEarth\"]+p[\"vEsc\"]; opt=p[\"nv\"]; \
(* \:6700\:5927\:901f\:5ea6\:53ca\:901f\:5ea6\:79ef\:5206\:8bbe\:7f6e *)\n \
Total[Table[\n  \
integrand[v_?NumericQ]:=SpeedPDF[v,p[\"v0\"],p[\"vEarth\"],p[\"vEsc\"]] \
TotalCrossSection[a,v,ms,dm,p]; (* \
\:6bcf\:4e2a\:901f\:5ea6\:7684\:603b\:622a\:9762\:4e58\:6982\:7387\:5bc6\
\:5ea6 *)\n  p[\"abundance\"][a] \
NIntegrate[integrand[v],{v,0,vmax},Method->{\"GlobalAdaptive\",\"SymbolicProc\
essing\"->0},AccuracyGoal->Infinity,PrecisionGoal->2,MaxRecursion->opt[\"MaxR\
ecursion\"]], (* \
\:6bcf\:79cd\:540c\:4f4d\:7d20\:72ec\:7acb\:79ef\:5206\:518d\:52a0\:6743 *)\n \
 {a,p[\"isotopes\"]}]] (* \
\:5929\:7136\:6c19\:5e73\:5747\:603b\:622a\:9762\:ff0cGeV^-2 \
*)\n];\nPrint[\"\:5df2\:5b9a\:4e49\:53cd\:51b2\:80fd\:91cf\:8fb9\:754c\:548c\
\:603b\:622a\:9762\:ff1b\:5b8c\:6574\:6570\:503c\:79ef\:5206\:5728\:4e0b\
\:4e00\:5355\:5143\:9009\:62e9\:8fd0\:884c\:3002\"];", "Input",
            CellLabel -> "In[1129]:=", ExpressionUUID ->
             "d09a2335-fb47-1b47-a529-ac245873a2f4"]}, Open]],
        Cell["\:4e0b\:9762\:7684\:5b8c\:6574\:5d4c\:5957\:79ef\:5206\:8ba1\
