chi2\:3001\:5b9e\:6807\:91cf\:53ca\:4e2d\:6027\:77e2\:91cf\:ff1agX V_mu \
chibar2 gamma^mu chi1 + gS s chibar2 chi1 + h.c. + gN V_mu Nbar gamma^mu \
N\:3002\:7a0b\:5e8f\:81ea\:52a8\:8fdb\:884c\:5384\:7c73\:5171\:8f6d\:68c0\
